   owl:annotatedSource <http://w3id.org/aqfo/AQFO_00015038> ;
   owl:annotatedProperty obo:IAO_0000115 ;
   owl:annotatedTarget "the activity of trying to catch fish. The term fishing broadly includes catching aquatic animals other than fish, such as crustaceans (shrimp/lobsters/crabs), shellfish, cephalopods (octopus/squid) and echinoderms (starfish/sea urchins)."@en ;
   oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Wikipedia Contributors. (2019, February 4). Fishing. Wikipedia; Wikimedia Foundation. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fishing"
 ] .


