                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/aqfo/AQFO_00020004> ;
                                     obo:IAO_0000115 "PE Pond Liner is a new polymer material, which is made of polyethylene. It is the most used plastic drainage film at present and can be used in many industries. Because of its lightweight, low cost, and convenient installation, it has been used in fishery."@en ;
