                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002232> ;
                                     obo:IAO_0000115 "A conical net with its perimeter lined with weights and a drawstring. It is cast from the shore or from a boat, and catches fish in shallow waters by falling and closing in them. " ;
