   owl:annotatedProperty obo:IAO_0000115 ;
   owl:annotatedTarget "It is a cereal, belonging to the family Poaceae. Of the total world production about 30% are consumed by man and the remaining 70% are used as feedstuffs. It has been utilized as one of the ingredients for the feeds of aquatic organisms." ;
   oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Hertrampf J. W. & Piedad-Pascual F. (2000). Maize products. In: Handbook on ingredients for aquaculture feeds (pp. 262-280). Dordrecht: Springer. ;https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-94-011-4018-8_28"
