                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002181> ;
                                     obo:IAO_0000115 "The part of the sea or ocean (or deep lake) consisting of the part of the water column near to (and significantly affected by) the seabed and the benthos." ;
