###  http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002226
<http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002226> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00001014> ;
                                     obo:IAO_0000115 "As part of modern Monitoring, Control and Surveillance systems (MCS) the vessel monitoring system (VMS) is a vessel tracking system (usually satellite-based) which provides management authorities with accurate information on fishing vessels position, course and speed at time intervals. Detail of VMS approved equipment and operational use will vary with the requirements of the nation of the vessel's registry, and the regional or national water in which the vessel is operating. " ;
                                     dc:contributor <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8461-9745> ;
                                     rdfs:label "boat tracker vms" .

