                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002228> ;
                                     obo:IAO_0000115 "Refers to the material used t construct the hull of a fishing boat. Most common are wood, steel,  ferrocement and fiberglass." ;
