###  http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002232
<http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002232> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002220> ;
                                     obo:IAO_0000115 "a net used for fishing. Nets can be made from various materials (monofilament or braided nylon, or natural fibres) that are knotted or woven into a mesh structure. Some fishing nets are also further engineered into fish traps, such as fyke nets. " ;
