<http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002234> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002215> ;
                                     obo:IAO_0000115 "Refers to the role of the fishers or the fishing vessel crew members based on their specialized skills. Fishing boats are usually composed of a captain, first and second mates, boatswain, and deckhands. The number of fishers varies depending on the fishing vessel's size and operation." ;
