                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://w3id.org/aqfo/aqfo_00002211> ;
                                     obo:IAO_0000115 "pisciculture or aquaculture involves commercial breeding of fish, usually for food, in fish tanks or artificial enclosures such as fish ponds. It is a particular type of aquaculture, which is the controlled cultivation and harvesting of aquatic animals such as fish, crustaceans, molluscs and so on, in natural or pseudo-natural environment" ;
                                     dc:contributor <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8461-9745> ;
                                     dcterms:creator <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4169-2456> ;
                                     rdfs:label "pisciculture" .


